                 "the Gym Leader after he joined\f"
                 "the Elite Four.")
    end
}

script Fuchsia_EventScript_Woman {
    simplenpcmsg("The Safari Zone wasn’t open\n"
                 "for a while.\r"
                 "Then it moved to Johto before\n"
                 "I knew it.\f"
                 "It’s sad...\r"
                 "It was this city’s main attraction.")
    end
}

script Fuchsia_EventScript_CitySign {
